{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/96a3a2038096cd0399a9ee57cbf7080e.avif?t=1754363669\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras_big/96a3a2038096cd0399a9ee57cbf7080e.avif?t=1754363669 width=800 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/559a8b07e566e9aa68dcb90d206cb2b1.avif?t=1754363669\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras_big/559a8b07e566e9aa68dcb90d206cb2b1.avif?t=1754363669 width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A comedic fantasy shooting game set in a magical world! Control Lotti, a saint, and face off against an army of orcs. Lose to the orcs, and you'll be subjected to humiliating training! Endure the trials, grow stronger, and strike back even harder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/6428a4d99bf6376664f239a02dd9eafb.avif?t=1754363669\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras_big/6428a4d99bf6376664f239a02dd9eafb.avif?t=1754363669 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/71583a27e2f26823cc3289e9e4aed8d4.avif?t=1754363669\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras_big/71583a27e2f26823cc3289e9e4aed8d4.avif?t=1754363669 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protagonist (Right): Charlotte von Pott, also known as Lotti. CV:Yuri Nanami</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Lady Saint who can create protective barriers to repel monsters. However, disliked by her fianc\u00e9\u2014the prince\u2014she is exiled to the frontier and tasked with purifying the cursed forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orcs (Left): Monsters born from the miasma engulfing the world. After rampaging for centuries, they now wish to be purified. Seeing potential in Lotti, they make the odd decision to train her in hopes she\u2019ll be the one to cleanse them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/36e5b683d594eee706c16f7b9159df0f.avif?t=1754363669\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras_big/36e5b683d594eee706c16f7b9159df0f.avif?t=1754363669 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magical bullets to repel waves of orcs advancing from the top of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/630aa42057c7de9125051c61c53045c8.avif?t=1754363669\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras_big/630aa42057c7de9125051c61c53045c8.avif?t=1754363669 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blue line represents Lotti\u2019s protective barrier. If it\u2019s destroyed, you lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/f47226f7d6c4e01710edd10e371d6990.avif?t=1754363669\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras_big/f47226f7d6c4e01710edd10e371d6990.avif?t=1754363669 width=800 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If defeated, Lotti undergoes training by the orcs, which in turn makes her stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras/f2029e6c8ef6ba6cec1059b3a2e32045.avif?t=1754363669\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486810/extras_big/f2029e6c8ef6ba6cec1059b3a2e32045.avif?t=1754363669 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Lotti purify the orcs and bring them the peace they long for?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginning of the cleansing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486810/46267704a122a762955aadfeea810ac106822550.jpg"},{"name":"In the dark forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486810/46267704a122a762955aadfeea810ac106822550.jpg"},{"name":"Purification complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486810/46267704a122a762955aadfeea810ac106822550.jpg"},{"name":"Private power generation saint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486810/46267704a122a762955aadfeea810ac106822550.jpg"},{"name":"Make them understand with your fists","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486810/46267704a122a762955aadfeea810ac106822550.jpg"},{"name":"The Holy Sword is Romantic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486810/46267704a122a762955aadfeea810ac106822550.jpg"},{"name":"Remember Humiliation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com